---
gitea:
  forge:
    # The generated applications live in an organization of their own, owned by jc-apps and by
    # no other machine user (owner decision 2026-09-26, T-2969): the Portal's build-pods pass
    # mints each App's runner registration token as an owner of that organization only. The
    # first apply moves every `{project}_{name}` repository out of the configuration's
    # organization; each App rebuilds once there (T-2856).
    appsOrganization: joinedcontext-apps
